ect with friends and people from across the globe!\n\nFind secret collectables hidden around the map!\n\nDo parkour in the Floor Is Lava game mode!\n\nBe frightened in the terrifying Horror!\n\nAnd much more!\n\nGrab your friends and play!", "short_description": "A game based on the famous \"gorilla locomotion\"  with lots of fun to be had with friend's and voice chat.\nBuy hats, holdables, badges, and more in the shop!\nPlay fun Mini games such as Clicker, Color Tiles and more!\nWatch movies in the theater from our amazing YouTubers!\nConnect with friends and people from across the globe!\nFind secret collectables hidden around the map!\nDo parkour in the Floor Is Lava game mode!\nBe frightened in the terrifying Horror!\nAnd much more!\nGrab your friends and play!"}]}, "developer_name": "WOWGAMES", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uEbAzgNtWN-nGfK4aKhnDbneIdh8bi8e7i1b544lg-8/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1lqcOeNcnbDMlUjqVIH0og_RABON2X4vc2rivRj7MOvc/edit?usp=sharing", "publisher_name": "WOW", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/probosciss/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "34360045570253161"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "c